    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "2eb1f7b4-1570-5c0e-a6a6-c2a726e95ea9",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x-y &=4 \\\\ 4x+4y &=-6 \\\\ 10x+23y &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 4 & -6 \\\\ 10 & 23 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 4 & -6 \\\\ 10 & 23 & -2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 10 & 23 & -2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(5){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 18 & 18\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-9){R}_{2} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, select: The system is consistent independent.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "4d28ae44-6bf2-5ae6-a22a-9bc9af2ad202",
          ":answer-field/key": "The system is inconsistent",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "2147614e-50d9-58e9-8910-5bb963a10d19",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
